<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">


<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CatGame - Game Information</title>


    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }


        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            color: #222;
        }


        header {
            background-color: #563d9c;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px 10%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }


        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }


        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }


        nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }


        .hero {
            background-color: #e9e3ff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px;
        }


        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }


        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: auto;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }


        .about {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }


        .about h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }


        .about p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }


        .game-modes {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px 20px 70px;
        }


        .game-modes h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }


        .cards {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 25px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }


        .card {
            background-color: white;
            width: 300px;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            text-align: center;
        }


        .card h3 {
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }


        .card p {
            line-height: 1.6;
        }


        .how-to-play {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }


        .how-to-play-content {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
        }


        .how-to-play h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }


        .how-to-play ol {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 2;
            padding-left: 30px;
        }


        .learn {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            background-color: #e9e3ff;
        }


        .learn h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }


        .learn p {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }


        footer {
            background-color: #222;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
        }


        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }


            nav a {
                margin: 0 10px;
            }


            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>


<body>


    <header>
        <div class="logo"> CatGame</div>


        <nav>
            <a href="#">Home</a>
            <a href="#">Information</a>
            <a href="#">Play Game</a>
        </nav>
    </header>


    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Welcome to CatGame</h1>


        <p>
            CatGame is an interactive quiz game that combines cats,
            animals, and geography. Test your knowledge while learning
            about different cat breeds and locations around the world.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="about">
        <h2>About the Game</h2>


        <p>
            CatGame is designed as a Kahoot-style multiple-choice game.
            Players will be presented with questions and will need to
            choose the correct answer from several choices. Questions
            will focus on identifying cat breeds, recognizing animals,
            and determining geographic locations.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="game-modes">
        <h2>Types of Questions</h2>


        <div class="cards">


            <div class="card">
                <h3>🌎 Guess the Location</h3>


                <p>
                    Players will be shown information about an animal or
                    cat breed and will need to identify the correct country
                    or geographic location.
                </p>
            </div>


            <div class="card">
                <h3>🐈 Guess the Cat</h3>


                <p>
                    Players may be shown an image of a cat and must choose
                    the correct breed from multiple possible answers.
                </p>
            </div>


            <div class="card">
                <h3>📝 Guess from a Description</h3>


                <p>
                    Players may also receive a description containing
                    characteristics of a cat and determine which breed
                    matches the description.
                </p>
            </div>


        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="how-to-play">
        <div class="how-to-play-content">


            <h2>How to Play</h2>


            <ol>
                <li>Start the CatGame.</li>
                <li>Read the question or examine the image provided.</li>
                <li>Select one answer from the available choices.</li>
                <li>Find out whether your answer is correct.</li>
                <li>Earn points for correct answers.</li>
                <li>Continue until all questions have been completed.</li>
            </ol>


        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="learn">
        <h2>Learn While You Play</h2>


        <p>
            The goal of CatGame is to make learning entertaining.
            Players can improve their knowledge of cat breeds, animal
            characteristics, countries, and geographic regions while
            competing for a high score.
        </p>
    </section>


    <footer>
        <p>CatGame | Cats, Animals & Geography</p>
    </footer>


</body>


</html>


